	(text "ESP32 battery-powered directly: no 3.3V regulator. GPIO LED active low.\\nRESET_N asserts low; no physical cell disconnect. Check ESP32 supply range.\\nSelect APX803L ~3.0V threshold; verify pinout, output type and complete MPN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 209.55 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bea0df2a-691b-4050-a7e2-5aa402d92a27")
	)
	(text "RESET_N resets ESP32 only; it does not disconnect or protect the cell. STATUS LED is active low.\nAPX803L 3.0 V suffix, pinout and output type require verification. BAT goes directly to ESP32.\nVerify ESP32 battery-voltage tolerance and solar-panel open-circuit voltage before use."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 188 0)
